0 STEP
0 // module-3: Layered wing: three terraced courses with cut-corner leading edges
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 alance-wing-port.ldr
0 STEP
0 // module-4: Slender lance nose; terraces give depth without thick edge stacks
1 16 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 alance-prow.ldr
0 STEP
0 // module-5: Frames the bridge; the shoulders stay low so the canopy reads as the focal feature
